this is my first file in the ParkZen project.
ParkZen idea: Suppose you wanna head to some shopping complex or a restaurant. You want to park your car in the parking slot
After going inside, what if you won't find any place there, you need to come out again and park it near the complex somewhere 
outside.. In this case, our time was consumed a lot and there might be a difficulty while coming out again due to parking congestion.
So here's our idea where our model will get to know the parking slots wheather empty or occupied through CCTV footages. If someone want
to enter this place and park their vehicle, this model will automatically detect the no.of parking slots available and if there's 
any slot empty, this model will allot us with the nearest parking slot available like "Parking slot empty, go to A4".
